
@startuml
title Activity Diagram 1 - Problem Reporting and Handling

start

:User enters problem details;
:User submits the report;

if (Required information complete?) then (Yes)
  :Create problem report;
  :Set status to SUBMITTED;
  :Make report available for review;
else (No)
  :Show validation errors;
  :User corrects the information;
  :Resubmit the report;
  if (Required information complete now?) then (Yes)
    :Create problem report;
    :Set status to SUBMITTED;
    :Make report available for review;
  else (No)
    :Ask user to correct the information;
    stop
  endif
endif

stop
@enduml
